  "response": "Here is the concrete, implementation-ready redesign spec for the PulseLane sandbox.\n\n## UX/UI Redesign Spec: PulseLane\n\n### Goals Achieved\n- **De-Web3:** Removed glowing auroras, heavy glassmorphism, and complex radial gradients in favor of a clean, modern, flat-dark aesthetic.\n- **Board as Primary Stage:** Eliminated the permanent sidebar. The board now occupies the full viewport width and height below the header.\n- **Compact Header:** The hero section collapses into a slim top navigation bar once the board is active.\n- **Card Identity:** Cards now clearly reflect their column and priority with refined visual cues (accent borders, minimalist priority dots).\n- **Lightweight Composer:** The bulky \"Add\" form is replaced with a subtle, seamless input that relies on keyboard interaction.\n\n---\n\n### Step-by-Step Implementation Plan\n\n#### 1. CSS Overhaul (`src/index.css`)\n- **Root & Background:** \n  - Remove the complex `radial-gradient` on `body`/`:root`. Replace with a solid, clean dark background: `background: #0f172a;`.\n  - Remove `.aurora`, `.aurora-left`, and `.aurora-right` classes entirely.\n- **Surfaces (Remove Glassmorphism):**\n  - Delete `.glass-panel` backdrop filters and heavy shadows. \n  - Create a simpler `.surface` class: `background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 12px;`. Apply this to modals, drawers, and lanes.\n- **Layout Reset:**\n  - Remove `.workspace-shell` (the grid that created the sidebar).\n  - Make `.app-shell` a `display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100vh; padding: 0; overflow: hidden;`.\n- **Header:**\n  - Update `.hero-bar` to `.top-bar`.\n  - Add `.top-bar.compact`: `padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;`.\n- **Lanes & Board:**\n  - `.board-shell`: `flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; padding: 1.5rem;`.\n  - `.lanes-scroll`: `flex: 1; height: 100%;`.\n  - `.lane-column`: simplify to `background: #0f172a; border: none; padding: 0 0.5rem;`.\n- **Card Redesign:**\n  - `.pulse-card`: `background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden;`.\n  - **Dynamic Column Accent:** Rely on inline CSS for `borderLeft: 4px solid var(--accent)`.\n  - `.priority-chip`: change from a bulky badge to a clean text label with a colored dot before it (e.g., `::before { content: ''; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; }`).\n- **Composer Redesign:**\n  - `.composer-input`: `background: transparent; border: 1px dashed #334155; border-radius: 8px; transition: all 0.2s;`. On `:focus`: `border: 1px solid #38bdf8; background: #1e293b;`.\n\n#### 2. Layout & Component Structure (`src/App.tsx`)\n- **Remove Auroras:** Delete `<div className=\"aurora...\" />` elements.\n- **Header Refactor:**\n  - Change `<header className=\"hero-bar\">` to `<header className={`top-bar ${board ? 'compact' : ''}`}>`.\n  - If `!board`, render the current large hero text.\n  - If `board`, render a compact row: `[PulseLane Logo] | [Board Title] --- [Seed/Reset Actions] [Status Pill] [Settings]`.\n- **Eliminate Sidebar (`.control-panel`):**\n  - Delete the `<aside className=\"control-panel\">` completely.\n  - Move the \"Reset starter board\" functionality to the compact header or into the connection settings modal.\n  - Move project stats (Total Cards, Document Path, Last Sync) into the `<section className=\"modal-card\">` (Connection Settings) so they are accessible but hidden from the primary board view.\n- **Main Board Stage:**\n  - Remove `.workspace-shell`. \n  - The board container should immediately follow the header: `<main className=\"board-shell\">`.\n  - Ensure `.board-topline` is removed or simplified since the board title is now in the compact header.\n- **Lane Component Updates (`LaneColumn`):**\n  - Pass `column.accent` as a CSS variable or inline style to the cards inside the lane to enforce visual identity.\n- **Card Component Updates:**\n  - Add an inline style for the column accent: `style={{ borderLeftColor: column.accent }}`.\n  - Simplify the inner layout. Group Priority and ID compactly.\n- **Composer Form Updates:**\n  - In `LaneColumn`, modify `<form className=\"composer-row\">`.\n  - Remove the `<button className=\"primary-button\">Add</button>`.\n  - Update the `<input>` to have a placeholder like `\"Type and press Enter...\"` and apply the new lightweight `.composer-input` class.\n\n#### 3. Execution Notes for Coding Agent\n1. **Phase 1: Cleanup.** Strip out `.aurora`, `.control-panel` (sidebar), and heavy CSS gradients.\n2. **Phase 2: Header & Modal Routing.** Convert the header to be responsive to the `board` state. Move sidebar actions (reset, seed) and metadata to the Settings modal.\n3. **Phase 3: Board Expansion.** Ensure the `.app-shell` and `.board-shell` use flexbox to make the lanes scrollable area take up 100% of the remaining vertical viewport.\n4. **Phase 4: Component Polish.** Apply the left-border accent to cards, shrink the priority chips into dots, and convert the composer into a borderless, enter-to-submit input.",
